      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA SEE ME (2) is a promising type who notched his 2nd career success when too good (25.72) at Q Lakeside last time. The form from his last run stacks up well. Can continue the winning form. STAND NEAR (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 6 lengths away in second (30.56) at this track in a Restricted WIN over 510m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Leading chance. CANYA INVINCIBLE (8) was in winning form two back (23.55) at this track but ran below best last time at Q Parklands, finishing 8th. Form here at the trip excellent including two wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. TIFF LATIMORE (6) generally performs well here at this distance.",
